; Solace Biosystems (GDD 8.3, 4.1): 32-Site City Grid. Home -> ten T1 Sites; eight of them
; open a T2 (Intel, Breach and Virus Exploits among them); every T2 opens a T3; every T3
; reaches the Renewal Engine (T4 boss). Four Heat objectives (two T1 -5, a T2 -8 off t1_j,
; a T3 -8 off t2_e). Locked cross-links open with the Intel Exploit (or Icebreakers).
; SiteObjective: 0 NONE, 1 EXPLOIT, 2 HEAT_REDUCTION, 4 BOSS. ExploitType: 1 INTEL, 2 BREACH, 3 VIRUS.

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="site_home"]
